WEBVTT

00:15:57.621 --> 00:16:01.746
or try to pin down your ambitions.
Just be with your brain.

00:16:01.996 --> 00:16:06.662
Rev your engine in neutral. Today
has two parts together.

00:16:06.662 --> 00:16:09.621
These assignments will probably take you
between twenty to thirty minutes,

00:16:09.621 --> 00:16:13.371
but absolutely feel free to take
more time and don't rush.

00:16:13.912 --> 00:16:15.912
And also don't overthink your answers.

00:16:15.912 --> 00:16:19.996
Try to just go with it and enjoy taking
this time to think about yourself.

00:16:19.996 --> 00:16:23.579
OK, all right. So the first
is fill in the blanks.

00:16:23.579 --> 00:16:26.829
You have been hearing beta testers
throughout this episode doing it.

00:16:27.121 --> 00:16:28.162
Here's the sentence. Right.

00:16:28.996 --> 00:16:33.746
I would describe this moment in my life
and career as blank and blank,